//RING OF CLUMSINESS - 1500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/RING04.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Ring"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A ring is a small band of precious metal that is used as jewelry. Some rare rings have had enchantments placed upon them that confer various magical abilities. These rings are highly sought after, especially by those of the adventuring profession.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 0"

	SAY NAME2 "Ring of Clumsiness"
	SAY DESC "The most notorious owner of this ring made a substantial living exploiting its cursed nature. Gregoria the Fool, a jester by trade, used his incomparable sleight of hand to switch this ring with one belonging to a patsy chosen from his audience. The rest of his performance involved mocking the newly clumsy individual, much to the delight of their comrades. The ring was removed (by a method known only to the wily jester) only after the stooge promised no reprisals for the treatment they had received, though Gregoria frequently still had to make a hasty retreat. What he didn't know was that the ring also held hidden abilities, which were revealed by an angry mage during his final performance at Zhentil Keep...


STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Dexterity: -50% penalty
– May only be removed with a Remove Curse spell

Charge abilities twice a day:
- Lighting Bolt (6d6 Electricity Damage, save vs. Wand for half) two times per day

Weight: 0"








