	SAY NAME2 "Ring of Invisibility"
	SAY DESC "Held by a master Thief for the better part of a generation, this ring was put to bold use in the markets of Waterdeep. Working a crowd in broad daylight, the rogue would steal countless numbers of purses from nobles, replacing them with bags of sand so the theft would go unnoticed. His identity was never known, but the name "Sandthief" was cursed loudly in its stead. It is rumored he retired, and now lives among the nobles he used to rob.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Invisibility three per day
  Duration: 12 hours
  Area of Effect: The wearer

Weight: 0"





