	SAY DESC "Often the bane of careless mages, this ring was actually used to promote humility. Hergat Norin, a grand wizard of Narfell, would give this ring, also known as the Discipliner, to his most skilled yet laziest students. Drastically weakening their learning abilities, the ring required all their willpower to unleash its true potential.

